              <div class="field__item">  <div class="paragraph paragraph--type--cta paragraph--view-mode--default">
          
            <div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--name-field-body field--type-text-long field--label-hidden field__item"><h2>SUNY Financial Aid Day</h2><h5>December 5 | 9 a.m. – 12 p.m.</h5><p>College is within reach, and we're here to help you get there! Join us at Onondaga Community College for SUNY Financial Aid Day. Get hands-on help completing your FAFSA, explore campus with an admissions tour, and get assistance with your application or Register Now form. Whether you're just getting started or ready to take the next step, we'll help make the process easier!</p><p><a class="btn-arrow-primary" href="https://engage.suny.edu/register/?id=f3e0eb15-77bb-4583-af69-74a4d38130cb" target="_blank" data-entity-type="external">Register for Financial Aid Day</a></p></div>
      
            <div class="field field--name-field-image field--type-entity-reference field--label-hidden field__item">  <img loading="lazy" src="/sites/default/files/styles/large/public/images/2026-11/Financial%20Aid%20day.webp?itok=eq_aOdYn" width="480" height="360" alt="student receiving Financial aid help" class="image-style-large" />


</div>
      
      </div>
</div>
              <div class="field__item">  <div class="paragraph paragraph--type--cta paragraph--view-mode--default">
          
            <div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--name-field-body field--type-text-long field--label-hidden field__item"><h2>Fall Open House Highlights</h2><p>We had a great time welcoming future students and families to OCC! Take a look back at the highlights from our 2026 Fall Open House.</p><p><a class="button" href="/2026-fall-open-house" data-entity-type="node" data-entity-uuid="5f3065f4-b885-4c5b-a995-ffef19f8a5f8" data-entity-substitution="canonical" title="2026 Fall Open House">See the Highlights</a></p></div>
      
            <div class="field field--name-field-image field--type-entity-reference field--label-hidden field__item">  <img loading="lazy" src="/sites/default/files/styles/large/public/images/2026-11/Fall%202026%20Open%20House-01.webp?itok=mKA0kpQB" width="480" height="360" alt="Blaze and potential students Fall Open House 2026" class="image-style-large" />


